<title>SWEDEN: Autoliv says to market new air bag.</title>
<headline>Autoliv says to market new air bag.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-06-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish-U.S. car safety group Autoliv said on Monday it had developed a more efficient air bag which catches the driver or passenger more quickly and gives a softer landing.</p>
<p>&quot;The manufacturing of this new system, which has been developed for Renault, will start toward the end of the year and will be introduced to all Renault's car models in 1998,&quot; it said in a statement.</p>
<p>The new technique will also be used by customers other than Renault, Autoliv said.</p>
<p>-- Birgitta Forsberg, Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700 1017</p>
